    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d233">

                <pb facs="0693" n="479" sameAs="frus:frus1871/pg479"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Fish to Mr.
                        Marsh</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1871-08-09"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >August</hi> 9, 1871.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Marsh</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Minister</hi>,
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Rome:</hi></p>
                <p>Referring to article twelve of the treaty with Great Britain of 8th May, the
                    President and Her Majesty the Queen of Great Britain have conjointly agreed to
                    receive Count <pb facs="0694" n="480" xml:id="pg480"/> Corti as the third
                    commissioner, to be appointed under that article, if the Italian government
                    consent to his serving. You will see your British colleague, and arrange with
                    him for a contemporaneous request to the Italian government for its consent, and
                    inform Department of answer by telegraph.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FISH, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
